mail_reset_text:
Someone asked for a new password for the {name} account {email}. Set it within one hour with this link:

{url}

If it was not you, ignore this mail; the password stays as it is.

mail_invite_text:
You have been invited to {name} as {email}.

Open this link within 7 days to choose a password: {url}

The link works once. If you did not expect this invitation, ignore this mail.

mail_password_link_text:
An admin of {name} created a link for your account {email} to set its password. Set it within 24 hours with this link:

{url}

The link works once. If you did not ask for it, tell the admin; your password stays as it is until the link is used.
